            "detailed_description": "VR Hockey League - the most realistic hockey training simulator for virtual reality devices.<br><br>Check yourself in the challenges, based on real hockey training. Improve your skills and collect a full collection of awards at the VR Hockey League Hall of Fame.<br><br>Experiment with physics, experience the pleasure of realism in controlling the puck, score goals in many ways.<br><br>The game is suitable for beginners in hockey. You can play by just one hand.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sensation of presence on the hockey ground<br></li><li> A protracted competitive process<br></li><li>Attention to detail<br></li><li> Realistic physics of possession of the puck<br></li><li> Tested by real hockey players</li></ul>",
