                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm not going to ask for a refund because it's early access... but.. the feel isn't right.  I had much better luck shooting with only one hand on the stick, as soon as the second hand got involved the movement became impossible to work with.  I'm hoping they make progress with it, as I definitely like the idea.  I'm going to put it down as \"recommend for never played hockey before people interested in a new perspective and a introduction to the game\" but if you have experience it may just drive you completely crazy in 0.1 hours.",
